<p>naam par shaah ke paani jo pila dete hai<br />
meere kousar inhei'n mujrayi dua dete hai</p>

<p>qatl akbar sa pisar hota hai sheh karte hai shukr<br />
sabre ayyub ko shabbir jila dete hai</p>

<p>fatima kehti hai dunya me ye aabaad rahei'n<br />
sheh ka pursa mujhe sab ahle azaa dete hai</p>

<p>chashme sajjad agar zouf se ho jaati hai band<br />
ashqiyaa'n paao'n ki zanjeer hila dete hai</p>

<p>roke kehti thi sakina ke hamei'n qaid kiya<br />
log zindaa'n se yateemo'n ko chudha dete hai</p>

<p>poochta hai jo koi kisne kamar ko toda<br />
shaah abbas ke laashe ko bata dete hai</p>

<p>arz aabid ne ye ki maangta hoo'n jab paani<br />
mujh ko dikhlaake sitamaar baha dete hai</p>

<p>zib'ha shaabir ko karta hai layee'n qanjar se<br />
bose hulqoom pa mehboobe khuda dete hai</p>